```

**Data Requirements:**
- Full legal name (required)
- Email address (required, unique per household)
- Date of birth (required)
- SSN (encrypted, optional)
- Primary address (required)
- Phone number (at least one: mobile or landline)
- Risk tolerance score
- Investment experience level
- Accredited investor status

**Business Rules:**
- Maximum 1 SSN per household (tax return filing purposes)
- Minimum age: 18 years old
- Relationship to primary client (required): Self, Spouse, Child, Parent, Other
- Email must be unique across platform (prevent duplicate clients)

**Validations:**
```
Email: RFC 5322 compliance check
SSN: Format XXXXX-XXX-XXXX, masked after entry
Date of Birth: <= today, >= 100 years ago
Phone: Valid US/Canadian format, or international E.164 format
Address: Zip code format validation
```

