**Monte Carlo Simulation Engine:**

```
Algorithm: Random Walk Based Monte Carlo

For each scenario (10,000 iterations):
    year = current_year
    balance = current_balance
    total_success = 0
    
    While year <= target_year:
        annual_return = Random(normal distribution, mean=6%, std=15%)
        balance = balance × (1 + annual_return)
        balance = balance + annual_contributions
        balance = balance - annual_withdrawals
        balance = balance - annual_fees
        year = year + 1
    
    If balance >= target_amount:
        total_success = total_success + 1
        final_amount = balance

success_probability = total_success / 10,000
percentile_10 = 10th lowest final_amount
percentile_50 = median final_amount
percentile_90 = 90th highest final_amount
```

